; Plan 39 export fixture: several commodities, costs and an implicit
; conversion. QIF has no currency field, so each commodity is its own file.

D $1,000.00
commodity 1.000,00 EUR

account assets:bank:checking    ; type: C
account assets:bank:euro        ; type: C
account assets:broker           ; type: A
account liabilities:card        ; type: L
account income:dividends        ; type: R
account expenses                ; type: X
account equity:opening          ; type: E

P 2026-01-01 AAPL $150.00
P 2026-01-01 EUR $1.10

2026-01-01 Opening
    assets:bank:checking        $5,000.00
    assets:bank:euro            1.000,00 EUR
    equity:opening              $-5,000.00
    equity:opening              -1.000,00 EUR

2026-01-03 Buy shares
    assets:broker               10 AAPL @ $150.00
    assets:bank:checking

2026-01-04 Paris hotel
    expenses:travel:lodging     180,00 EUR
    liabilities:card            -180,00 EUR

2026-01-05 Wire to euro account
    assets:bank:euro            500,00 EUR @@ $550.00
    assets:bank:checking

2026-01-06 Currency swap
    assets:bank:euro            100,00 EUR
    assets:bank:checking         $-109.00

2026-01-20 Dividend
    assets:bank:checking            $12.00
    income:dividends
